###############################################
# Redis API 测试
###############################################

### 1. 设置键值对
POST http://localhost:9501/api/redis/set
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "key": "test:key1",
    "value": "Hello Redis",
    "ttl": 3600
}

### 2. 获取值
GET http://localhost:9501/api/redis/get/test:key1
Content-Type: application/json

### 3. 检查键是否存在
GET http://localhost:9501/api/redis/exists/test:key1
Content-Type: application/json

### 4. 删除键
DELETE http://localhost:9501/api/redis/delete/test:key1
Content-Type: application/json

### 5. 设置复杂数据结构
POST http://localhost:9501/api/redis/set
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "key": "user:1",
    "value": {
        "id": 1,
        "name": "John Doe",
        "email": "john@example.com",
        "created_at": "2024-01-01T00:00:00Z"
    },
    "ttl": 7200
}

### 6. 获取复杂数据结构
GET http://localhost:9501/api/redis/get/user:1
Content-Type: application/json 